{"id":"n72162-1-8","stage":0,"title":"카페 · 咖啡店","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72162-1-8-1","ko":"밥도 다 먹었는데 이제 뭘 할까요?","zh":"饭都吃完了，现在要做什么呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밥도","meaning":"饭，餐","explanation":"밥：饭，餐；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"2","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹었는데","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할까요?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭，餐","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"每天在一定时间吃的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f2cc5674613ebb00567f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72162-1-8-2","ko":"카페에 가서 차나 한잔합시다.","zh":"我们去咖啡馆喝杯茶吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"카페에","meaning":"咖啡店，咖啡馆","explanation":"카페：咖啡店，咖啡馆；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"카페","audio":"/audio/53cc9fb21b3694bf4cb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72162","senseId":"1","lemma":"카페","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차나","meaning":"茶，茶水","explanation":"차：茶，茶水；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61117","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한잔합시다.","meaning":"喝一杯","explanation":"한잔하다：喝一杯；ㅂ시다：较正式的提议句末：“一起……吧”，通常用于平辈或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"한잔하다","audio":"/audio/0daf602b903f50885a5b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62372","senseId":"1","lemma":"한잔하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"53cc9fb21b3694bf","term":"카페","zh":"咖啡店，咖啡馆","audio":"/audio/53cc9fb21b3694bf4cb3.mp3","entryId":"72162","definition":"主要销售咖啡、茶、点心等的店铺。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"茶，茶水","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"61117","definition":"将有香气或味道好的植物叶子、根或果实等熬制或泡制之后做成的可以喝的东西。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"0daf602b903f5088","term":"한잔하다","zh":"喝一杯","audio":"/audio/0daf602b903f50885a5b.mp3","entryId":"62372","definition":"稍微喝一场茶、酒等。","pronunciation":["한잔하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2d18f7e0e2d04c16fe2e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.76,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72162","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":24,"sequenceScore":1.2401,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我们去咖啡馆喝杯茶吧。","现在几点？","饭都吃完了，现在要做什么呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我们去咖啡馆喝杯茶吧。","饭都吃完了，现在要做什么呢？","现在几点？"],"answer":0}]}
